@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-10 PayOS Payment Processing

class "Checkout / Payment UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "PaymentController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "PaymentService" as Service <<service>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "ShoeDetail" as ShoeDetail <<domain>>
class "Coupon" as Coupon <<domain>>
class "OrderEmailService" as OrderEmailService <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : POST /payments
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> ShoeDetail : uses
Service --> Coupon : uses
Service --> OrderEmailService : uses
Service --> "PayOS Gateway" : integrates

note right of UI
UC-10 - PayOS Payment Processing
Actors: Guest, User, PayOS Gateway
Pre: Bill đã tạo, payment link pending
Post: Payment hoàn tất hoặc hủy
end note
@enduml
